THIRD-PARTY VENDORED ARTIFACTS
==============================

This directory contains a small set of third-party SKY130 library artifacts that
are NOT authored by the HCMUT_DICD course. They are redistributed here so the
back-end flow (synth / STA / gate-sim / power) is self-contained. Attribution and
licenses:

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/  --  high-density standard-cell library (SUBSET)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Views:   lib/sky130_fd_sc_hd__tt_025C_1v80.lib   (typical-corner timing; synth + STA)
         verilog/sky130_fd_sc_hd.v, verilog/primitives.v  (cell models; gate-sim)
         lef/sky130_fd_sc_hd.lef                  (abstract)
         techlef/sky130_fd_sc_hd__{min,nom,max}.tlef (+ rram variants)
This is the MINIMAL subset the flow reads (one timing corner) -- NOT the whole
library (no GDS, no other corners). Full APR still needs a complete external PDK.

